      "machineHash": "e1aded516605d39fd3a24fe287b80d33ab59eb606d930d53ebf9195659b63c65",
      "machineText": "Secara default, sebagian besar elemen tidak dapat diseret. Agar elemen dapat diseret, tambahkan `draggable=\"true\"`:",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "By default, most elements can't be dragged. To make an element draggable, add `draggable=\"true\"`:",
